6
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:20,010
Sir, I bombed.

7
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:23,980
That's why God gave us the laugh track.

8
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:28,250
People, be seated. Remember,

9
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:28,250
