25
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:01,920
Here's my card.

26
00:01:02,890 --> 00:01:05,330
"In Your Face, Limited."

27
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,660
Mr. Hodo walked up

28
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,660
