34
00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:17,430
That's a deadly weapon?

35
00:01:17,610 --> 00:01:20,410
I could have sworn it had thawed.

36
00:01:22,010 --> 00:01:23,240
Aha.

37
00:01:23,410 --> 00:01:27,440
Mr. Milch suffered numerous lacerations

38
00:01:23,410 --> 00:01:27,440
