115
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:41,260
Yeah, that show scarred a lot of us.

116
00:05:41,940 --> 00:05:44,410
Listen, Leon, we all get into fights...

117
00:05:44,570 --> 00:05:47,010
...but it's not fair

118
00:05:44,570 --> 00:05:47,010
