287
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:43,850
I talked to that lady who handles your case

288
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:43,850
for Juvenile.

289
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:48,060
She says you run away a lot,

290
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:48,060
