315
00:13:31,470 --> 00:13:32,960
Yeah.

316
00:13:33,140 --> 00:13:34,700
Well, it's been 12 years.

317
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:39,250
How come nobody has come

318
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:39,250
