379
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:20,640
Put up or shut up.

380
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:24,570
It's a very generous offer, Judge Stone.

381
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:26,910
But you realize

382
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:26,910
