388
00:16:40,630 --> 00:16:43,260
I will enjoy him while he's there.

389
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:48,130
And I will miss him when he's gone.

390
00:16:51,470 --> 00:16:53,240
What do you say, huh?

391
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:56,770
I mean, we've always gotten along,

392
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:56,770
