399
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:25,300
Harry must feel very fulfilled.

400
00:17:25,470 --> 00:17:27,370
I'm sure he does.

401
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:30,510
That's probably why

402
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:30,510
