417
00:18:15,290 --> 00:18:17,490
All right.

418
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:20,360
Congratulations.

419
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:23,230
Well, I'll be.

420
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:25,490
Congratulations, sir.

421
00:18:25,670 --> 00:18:27,460
Thank you. Thank you.

422
00:18:28,870 --> 00:18:30,630
