433
00:18:59,030 --> 00:19:01,560
Sir, I....

434
00:19:04,310 --> 00:19:05,570
I....

435
00:19:14,050 --> 00:19:17,680
When she gets emotional,

436
00:19:14,050 --> 00:19:17,680
