444
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:36,730
Harry...

445
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:41,330
...I know this is gonna sound stupid

446
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:41,330
and all...

447
00:19:41,510 --> 00:19:44,210
