471
00:21:15,870 --> 00:21:17,530
Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

472
00:21:17,710 --> 00:21:19,970
You don't have to cover for me.

473
00:21:20,140 --> 00:21:21,610
I was the one that called them.

474
00:21:21,780 --> 00:21:24,940
Uh-uh. Uh-uh.

475
