507
00:22:52,730 --> 00:22:55,760
I really do.

508
00:22:55,940 --> 00:22:57,030
Well, that's okay, Bull.

509
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:59,230
Dan ended up getting the best

510
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:59,230
