513
00:23:02,540 --> 00:23:04,670
- Judge Stone?

514
00:23:02,540 --> 00:23:04,670
- Yo.

515
00:23:06,710 --> 00:23:08,480
From a friend.

516
00:23:14,460 --> 00:23:17,550
I'm in deep doggy doo, aren't I?

